@startuml
title DFD Level 0: Context Diagram
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

rectangle "Lender\n(TU Student / Staff)" as Lender
rectangle "Borrower\n(TU Student / Staff)" as Borrower
usecase "0.0\nCampusShare\nLending System" as System
rectangle "TU REST API\n(Active Directory)" as TUAPI

Lender --> System : Login Credentials, Item Info,\nApproval/Rejection, Evidence Photos
System --> Lender : Session JWT, Incoming Requests,\nLoan History & Evidence

Borrower --> System : Login Credentials, Search Query,\nBorrow Request, Evidence Photos
System --> Borrower : Session JWT, Available Items,\nBorrow Status & Evidence

System --> TUAPI : UserName & PassWord\n(Application-Key)
TUAPI --> System : Verification Status,\nProfile & Active Status
@enduml
